## 4. Major Components Explained

### 🔄 Live Ticker Bar
- A scrolling horizontal bar at the top showing all 12 coins with price + 24h change
- Uses CSS `animation: tickerScroll 40s linear infinite` for smooth scrolling
- Content is **duplicated** (`items + items`) to create a seamless infinite loop
- Pauses on hover (`animation-play-state: paused`)

### 📊 Summary Cards (4 Glassmorphism Cards)
| Card | Shows | Source |
|------|-------|--------|
| 💰 Total Investment | Sum of (qty × buyPrice) for all holdings | Calculated from portfolio array |
| 📈 Current Value | Sum of (qty × livePrice) for all holdings | Calculated using live `prices` object |
| 💎 Total Profit/Loss | Current Value − Total Investment | Derived |
| ⚡ Return % | (P/L ÷ Investment) × 100 | Derived |

### 📋 Holdings Table
- Sortable by any column (click column headers)
- Uses a custom sort function with toggle between ascending/descending
- Shows coin emoji, name, symbol, quantity, buy price, current price, value, P/L
- Each row has a "Remove" button

### 🍩 Portfolio Allocation Bar
- A horizontal stacked bar showing percentage allocation per coin
- Only appears when you have investments
- Each segment is color-coded to the coin's brand color
- Includes a legend below with percentages

### 🌐 Crypto Market Grid
- 12 cards showing live data for each coin
- Each card has: emoji, name, symbol, price, 24h change, market cap, volume, **sparkline chart**
- **Searchable** — type in the search box to filter coins
- Cards have hover animations (lift + shadow)

### 📈 Sparkline Charts (Canvas)
- Mini 7-day price charts drawn on HTML5 `<canvas>` elements
- [`drawSparkline()`](file:///d:/blockchain%20min-project/script.js#L573-L640) downsamples 168 points to ~100 for performance
- **Green** gradient fill for positive 24h change, **Red** for negative
- Uses `devicePixelRatio` for crisp rendering on high-DPI screens

### 🔔 Toast Notifications
- Slide-in/out animated notifications (bottom-right corner)
- Three types: `success` (✅ green), `error` (❌ red), `info` (ℹ️ blue)
- Auto-dismiss after 4 seconds

