## 6. Data Persistence with localStorage

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["User adds investment"] --> B["portfolio.push(item)"]
    B --> C["savePortfolio()"]
    C --> D["localStorage.setItem(<br/>'cryptoPortfolio', JSON)"]

    E["Page reload"] --> F["JSON.parse(<br/>localStorage.getItem(<br/>'cryptoPortfolio'))"]
    F --> G["portfolio array restored"]
```

> [!NOTE]
> Portfolio data survives page refreshes and browser restarts because it's saved to `localStorage`. However, it is **local to the browser** — clearing browser data or using a different browser/device will lose the data.

