## 7. Key Design Patterns Used

| Pattern | Where | Why |
|---------|-------|-----|
| **Glassmorphism** | All `.glass-card` elements | Modern frosted-glass UI look using `backdrop-filter: blur()` |
| **CSS Custom Properties** | `:root` variables | Centralized theme — easy to change colors, spacing, transitions |
| **Responsive Grid** | Summary cards, market grid, form | Adapts from 4-column to 1-column based on screen width |
| **Staggered Animations** | `.glass-card:nth-child(n)` | Cards fade in one after another for a polished feel |
| **Infinite Scroll Ticker** | Ticker bar with `translateX(-50%)` | Seamless loop by duplicating content |
| **Canvas Sparklines** | Market card charts | Lightweight charts without any charting library |
| **Toast Notifications** | User feedback system | Non-intrusive slide-in/out messages |
| **Shimmer Loading** | Market grid placeholders | Skeleton screens shown while API data loads |

