## 9. Key Talking Points for Presentation

If you're presenting this project, cover these points:

1. **Problem Statement** — "Crypto investors need a simple way to track their portfolio without creating accounts on exchanges"
2. **Tech Stack** — Pure HTML/CSS/JS, no frameworks, CoinGecko free API
3. **Real-Time Data** — Live prices refreshed every 60 seconds with countdown + manual refresh
4. **Client-Side Storage** — localStorage for zero-backend simplicity
5. **Calculations** — P/L, return %, portfolio allocation — all derived in real-time
6. **UX Polish** — Glassmorphism design, sparkline charts, toast notifications, shimmer loading states, infinite ticker
7. **Error Resilience** — Rate-limit handling with exponential backoff, cached data fallback
8. **Responsiveness** — Works on desktop, tablet, and mobile (3 breakpoints)
9. **Export Feature** — Download portfolio as JSON for backup
10. **Scalability** — Easy to add more coins (just add to `COINS` object + dropdown)

